.Dd November 17, 2026
.Dt TIMES 1
.Os RavenBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm times
.Nd print POSIX process times
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Nm
utility writes the POSIX two-line process-times form:
.Dl 0m0.00s 0m0.00s
.Dl 0m0.00s 0m0.00s
.Pp
The kernel has no process CPU-time clock, so the target writes zero ticks.
The formatting path is host-tested and ready for the accounting syscall.
.Sh EXIT STATUS
Returns 0; an operand or option is a usage error with status 2.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr time 1
